OL,3,GNEWSAE-bike crime crackdown leads to
OL,4,A187 arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police has arrested
OL,7,F187 people and seized 157 vehicles as
OL,8,Fpart of a crackdown on prolific thieves
OL,9,Fusing e-bikes and mopeds in
OL,10,FWestminster.
OL,12,FThe arrests were for a variety of
OL,13,Foffences including possession of
OL,14,Fdangerous weapons, drug-related crimes,
OL,15,Frobbery and theft.
OL,17,FThe force said plain-clothed and
OL,18,Funiformed officers carried out patrols
OL,19,Fin hotspot areas and stopped offenders
OL,20,Fknown to police. The operations ran
OL,21,Ffrom February to July.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
