OL,3,GNEWSAE-bike crime crackdown leads to
OL,4,A187 arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Supt Gareth Gilbert, who led the
OL,7,Foperation, said officers were "staying
OL,8,Fone step ahead of the criminals who use
OL,9,Fhigh-powered bikes or mopeds to steal
OL,10,Ffrom Londoners".
